  <entry>
    <title>두 번째 앱 출시기 3 — 앱·웹·assetlinks의 딥링크 경로를 맞췄습니다</title>
    <link href="https://blog.twinklelabs.kr/pocket-pdf/app-links-three-repos-deep-link.html" rel="alternate"/>
    <id>https://blog.twinklelabs.kr/pocket-pdf/app-links-three-repos-deep-link.html</id>
    <published>2026-09-02T13:30:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-09-02T13:30:00.000Z</updated>
    <author><name>Heejeong Kim</name></author>
    <category term="Pocket PDF"/>
    <category term="android"/>
    <category term="pocket-pdf"/>
    <category term="딥링크"/>
    <category term="AppLinks"/>
    <category term="웹"/>
    <summary type="html">앱이 두 개로 늘어나면서 딥링크를 /app/&lt;제품&gt; 경로로 통일했습니다. 앱의 인텐트 필터, 웹 소개 페이지, assetlinks.json이 같은 주소와 서명 정보를 사용하도록 맞췄습니다.</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Stock Calculator에 이어 Pocket PDF를 만들면서 앱별 링크와 QR 코드의 경로를 정리했습니다. 기존처럼 QR에 Google Play 주소(&lt;code&gt;https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=...&lt;/code&gt;)를 넣으면 앱이 설치된 사용자도 스토어로 이동했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이미 인쇄한 QR은 스토어 주소나 패키지명이 바뀌어도 수정할 수 없습니다. &lt;code&gt;utm_source&lt;/code&gt; 같은 유입 정보도 직접 스토어로 보내는 링크만으로는 원하는 방식으로 관리하기 어려웠습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;그래서 &lt;a href=&quot;https://twinklelabs.kr&quot;&gt;twinklelabs.kr&lt;/a&gt;을 진입 주소로 쓰고 Android App Links를 연결했습니다. 앱이 설치된 환경과 웹으로 들어오는 환경을 같은 주소에서 처리하려는 작업이었습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;제품마다-달랐던-경로를-통일했습니다&quot;&gt;제품마다 달랐던 경로를 통일했습니다&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;처음에는 &lt;code&gt;/stock-calculator/app&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/pocket-pdf/download&lt;/code&gt;처럼 서로 다른 경로를 썼습니다. 제품이 늘어날 때마다 형식을 다시 정하지 않도록, 저장소의 &lt;code&gt;app/&lt;/code&gt; 분류를 URL에도 적용했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;astro-code astro-code-themes catppuccin-latte tokyo-night&quot; style=&quot;--shiki-light:#4c4f69;--shiki-dark:#a9b1d6;--shiki-light-bg:#eff1f5;--shiki-dark-bg:#1a1b26; overflow-x: auto;&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-language=&quot;txt&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;https://twinklelabs.kr/app/&amp;#x3C;제품_슬러그&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Calculator: &lt;code&gt;https://twinklelabs.kr/app/stock-calculator&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pocket PDF: &lt;code&gt;https://twinklelabs.kr/app/pocket-pdf&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;새 제품도 이 형식에 제품 슬러그를 넣도록 정했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;앱-웹-도메인-설정을-함께-바꿨습니다&quot;&gt;앱, 웹, 도메인 설정을 함께 바꿨습니다&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;링크를 받는 Android 앱에서는 &lt;code&gt;AndroidManifest.xml&lt;/code&gt;에 &lt;code&gt;autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;&lt;/code&gt; 인텐트 필터를 선언했습니다. Pocket PDF는 &lt;code&gt;https://twinklelabs.kr/app/pocket-pdf&lt;/code&gt;를 수신하도록 등록했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;브랜드 웹사이트 &lt;code&gt;home&lt;/code&gt;에는 같은 경로의 소개 페이지를 만들었습니다. 브라우저로 접속한 사용자는 여기에서 제품 설명을 보고 스토어 다운로드 경로로 이동할 수 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;도메인 루트의 &lt;code&gt;.well-known/assetlinks.json&lt;/code&gt;에는 앱 패키지와 Google Play 콘솔의 앱 서명 키 인증서 SHA-256 지문을 등록했습니다. Android가 도메인과 앱의 연결을 확인할 때 사용하는 정보입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;astro-code astro-code-themes catppuccin-latte tokyo-night&quot; style=&quot;--shiki-light:#4c4f69;--shiki-dark:#a9b1d6;--shiki-light-bg:#eff1f5;--shiki-dark-bg:#1a1b26; overflow-x: auto;&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-language=&quot;json&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;  {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;    &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#1E66F5;--shiki-dark:#7AA2F7&quot;&gt;relation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt; [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#9ECE6A&quot;&gt;delegate_permission/common.handle_all_urls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;    &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#1E66F5;--shiki-dark:#7AA2F7&quot;&gt;target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;      &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#1E66F5;--shiki-dark:#0DB9D7&quot;&gt;namespace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt; &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#9ECE6A&quot;&gt;android_app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;      &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#1E66F5;--shiki-dark:#0DB9D7&quot;&gt;package_name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt; &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#9ECE6A&quot;&gt;kr.twinklelabs.pocketpdf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;      &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#1E66F5;--shiki-dark:#0DB9D7&quot;&gt;sha256_cert_fingerprints&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt; [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#9ECE6A&quot;&gt;8D:04:71:...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#40A02B;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;    }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;  }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;line&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--shiki-light:#7C7F93;--shiki-dark:#9ABDF5&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 세 부분에서 주소, 패키지명, 서명 정보가 맞아야 의도한 앱으로 연결됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;설치-여부에-따라-진입-경로를-나눴습니다&quot;&gt;설치 여부에 따라 진입 경로를 나눴습니다&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pocket PDF가 설치된 폰에서는 링크가 앱의 메인 화면으로 바로 이어졌습니다. 당시에는 실행 시간을 0.1초로 적었지만, 기기와 측정 조건은 함께 기록하지 않았습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;앱이 설치되지 않은 폰이나 PC에서는 &lt;code&gt;twinklelabs.kr/app/pocket-pdf&lt;/code&gt; 소개 화면을 거쳐 Play Store 다운로드 버튼을 이용하게 했습니다. 웹에서는 &lt;code&gt;utm_source&lt;/code&gt;와 유입 꼬리표를 붙여 스토어로 전달했습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;QR에는 제품의 도메인 주소를 담고, 앱과 웹은 &lt;code&gt;/app/&amp;#x3C;제품&gt;&lt;/code&gt;이라는 같은 경로를 관리하게 됐습니다. 앱이 하나 더 늘면서 각각 정해두었던 링크 규칙을 맞춘 결과입니다.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
